        <briefdescription>
<para>This constructor can promote a <ref refid="classJSBSim_1_1LogException" kindref="compound">LogException</ref> to an <ref refid="classJSBSim_1_1XMLLogException" kindref="compound">XMLLogException</ref> by adding the file location information to the exception. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>This is useful to add some context to an exception that was thrown in a context where the file location of the error was not known. <parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>exception</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The <ref refid="classJSBSim_1_1LogException" kindref="compound">LogException</ref> to promote. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>el</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The <ref refid="classJSBSim_1_1Element" kindref="compound">Element</ref> containing the file location of the error. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
